 to feed  upon they arrive on earth but due to  carnage now being corrupted it becomes  cannibalistic and he begins to attack  the other symbiotes and feed upon them  this is similar to how riot absorbed  venom in the first film and it's  apparently what we will see when the  symbiote reached earth and venom to  carnage will absorb them all and become  stronger because of it and we will get  the giant carnage from the comics  however carnage doesn't absorb riot or  shriek and instead he plays it cool and  pretends to be their ally waiting until  the right moment to absorb them he  becomes their leader and together they  all team up against venom now according  to this new leak this is apparently  where venom slash Eddie Brock is going  to reach out to spider-man slash Peter  Parker now if we think about who Eddie  Brock is he's a reporter and a pretty  good reporter at that he probably is  kept up with the events of spider-man  and since Mysterio revealed spider-man  to actually be Peter Parker and  spider-man far from home Eddie Brock  knows that spider-man is Peter Parker  Eddie Brock with his reporter skills is  probably somewhat of a good detective as  well so if he wanted to find spider-man  he probably could and according to this  leak that's what he's going to do and  that's all this leaks says but we did  have another leak a couple of months ago  that said that spider-man was going to  be in the end of venom 2 and the final  battle venom is about to kill Cletus  Kasady not carnage but Cletus Kasady but  spider-man  stops him and this is apparently where  venom is going to turn on spider-man and  this will start their long lasting feud  and apparently could somehow in the  future set up a spider-man vs. venom  film but that's a long shot  however spider-man appearing in venom is  not a long shot and is actually pretty  probable about a week ago Tom Hardy  posted a picture to his Instagram of  venom eating spider-man he basically bit  him in half but he delete